 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp75130400\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp42175520\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/0a20d22c57e7471fef328fbfc40c11f11f0f0234\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n    <p id=\"fs-idp29188400\">Watch this short video to learn more about the founder and bottleneck effects.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1164438765350\" data-alt=\"founder_bottle\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/19-2-population-genetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/founder_bottle\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>\n",
